  "description": "Fauntastic is an annual French furry convention near Lyon, organized by Faun Events, an association registered in Rhône. The first edition, \"Celtic Tales\", was held May 30 to June 2, 2019, at the Hôtel Vallée Bleue in Montalieu-Vercieu, with 174 attendees. The 2020 and 2021 conventions were replaced by eFaun, an online convention on Discord, and since 2022 it has been held in Saint-Priest, Rhône, at hotels by the Lyon Eurexpo center. Each edition has a theme, and attendance has grown to about 500.",
